  "body": "![title](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f0b6c0a068fbd71ea8989bae1ee9e9be2be63a38.png)\n\n\nA horror modpack that is meant to be terrifying and challenging\n\n*and funny at times*\n_________________________________________________________________________________________\n-content-\n\nadds many iconic horror mods such as:\n\n<details>\n<summary>Spoiler</summary>\n\n- From The Fog \"also known as the Herobrine mod\"\n- The Man From The Fog\n- The Midnight Lurker\n- The Better Cave Dweller\n- The Knocker\n- Nyf's Spiders\n- Sanity: Descent Into Madness\n- Doctor Who: Weeping Angels\n- And other mods such as preformance mods, shaders, and guns to help with smoothness and immersion\n\n</details>\n\n\n_____________________________________________________________________________________\n**the mod may have jumpscares**\n**and loud effects**\n_________________________________________________________\n\n****if you want to be spooked, then this is the modpack for you****\n\n*reccomended with friends*",
